  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></h3><p>MARAPON specializes in high-quality window films designed for privacy, decoration, and sun protection. Our range includes privacy films, frosted films, heat-control films, and decorative designs suitable for homes, offices, and commercial spaces. All products are easy to install, durable, and tailored to provide functional benefits without compromising aesthetics.</p><h3><strong>What makes us different:</strong></h3><p>We focus on premium materials, modern designs, and user-friendly application. Our films offer long-lasting adhesion, bubble-free installation, and reliable performance. Customers appreciate our clear instructions, high product quality, and the ability to upgrade any window without expensive renovations.</p><h3><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></h3><p>Affiliates earn competitive commissions on every sale made through their personal referral link. With our broad audience—homeowners, renters, interior enthusiasts, and DIY fans—there is strong earning potential and consistent demand throughout the year.</p><h3><strong>How to promote us:</strong></h3><p>Promote MARAPON products through social media, blogs, home-improvement content, DIY tutorials, or before-and-after transformations. Showcase how easy installation is, demonstrate privacy effects, or highlight energy-saving benefits. We provide product images, descriptions, and tips to support your content.</p><h3><strong>Other information:</strong></h3><p>We offer fast payouts, regular promotions, and new product releases throughout the year. Affiliates can reach out anytime for questions, support, or custom media material. We value long-term partnerships and are committed to helping affiliates succeed.</p></div></div>",
